# Downloaded AESO archives. These are inputs, not outputs: build_hourly.R turns
# each one into a CSV under hourly/, and they are re-downloadable from Box at
# any time by fetch_box.sh. ~2 MB of incompressible binary per month is not
# something to keep in git history forever.
raw/

# The analysis project's supply.R holds the chart code, the colour palette and
# the commentary, none of which belongs in a public repo. It was copied here
# once by accident and had to be scrubbed from history. The ingest side needs
# only csd_parse.R, which is why that file exists separately.
supply.R
